INJECTION 3 -- a uniform scale on VORP. audible#85's `shrink`, reproduced.
==============================================================================
  The claim under test: contracting points toward the position mean contracts each
  player and his own replacement by the same factor, so every VORP scales by (1-s)
  and no pair can cross. That assumes the REPLACEMENT RANK is stable.
    2019  s=0.40  players displaced: 0   board identical: True
    2020  s=0.40  players displaced: 377   board identical: False
    2021  s=0.40  players displaced: 0   board identical: True
    2022  s=0.40  players displaced: 0   board identical: True
    2024  s=0.40  players displaced: 353   board identical: False
    2025  s=0.40  players displaced: 0   board identical: True
  total displacements across every season and every s tested: 2190

  SHRINK IS NOT INERT. It moves the board in two seasons, so the condition
  'moves an ordering in >= 2 seasons' does NOT reject it, and raising that count
  until it did would be gerrymandering. The condition that rejects it names the
  MECHANISM instead: a position-scope term must carry WITHIN-POSITION information.
  Run through the real gate rather than counted by hand:

